      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article describes the natural history, pathogenesis and diagnosis of Aspirin Exacerbated Respiratory Disease. The evidence base for the role of oral aspirin and nasal L-Lysine-aspirin desensitisation is reviewed. Evidence for the role of dietary salicylic acid and its avoidance is also reviewed."},
